  s: A launch profile that does not open the browser: allowed by the oracle; M's default opens Swagger UI.
22 CO API-016 | Do not document 201 for 200 or 204 for a body; consider the whole pipeline but not merely theoretical statuses (API-016).
23 CO API-016 | Document 201 only when it is the runtime contract (API-016).
24 CO API-016 API-008 | Describe ProblemDetails contracts where useful; no internal details in Swagger examples (API-016, API-008).
